     "statement": "讀入 `n m`（1 ≤ n, m ≤ 60），輸出 `n` 列 `m` 行的螺旋矩陣：從左上角開始，順時針向內填入 `1, 2, …, n·m`。\n\n每個數字**靠右對齊**，寬度為 `n·m` 的位數，數字之間以一個空白分隔（行尾不要有多餘空白——判題會忽略行尾空白，但好習慣很重要）。\n\n### 輸入範例\n```text\n3 4\n```\n### 輸出範例\n```text\n 1  2  3  4\n10 11 12  5\n 9  8  7  6\n```\n",
     "starter": "n, m = map(int, input().split())\n",
     "solution": "n, m = map(int, input().split())\ngrid = [[0] * m for _ in range(n)]\ndr, dc = [0, 1, 0, -1], [1, 0, -1, 0]\nr = c = d = 0\nfor k in range(1, n * m + 1):\n    grid[r][c] = k\n    nr, nc = r + dr[d], c + dc[d]\n    if not (0 <= nr < n and 0 <= nc < m and grid[nr][nc] == 0):\n        d = (d + 1) % 4\n        nr, nc = r + dr[d], c + dc[d]\n    r, c = nr, nc\nw = len(str(n * m))\nfor row in grid:\n    print(\" \".join(f\"{v:>{w}}\" for v in row))\n",
