     "starter": "def flatten(obj):\n    ...\n",
     "solution": "def flatten(obj):\n    result = []\n    stack = [iter([obj])]\n    while stack:\n        for item in stack[-1]:\n            if isinstance(item, (list, tuple)):\n                stack.append(iter(item))\n                break\n            result.append(item)\n        else:\n            stack.pop()\n    return result\n",
